  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4853,
      "text": "with eyes downcast, they will come out of the graves like scattered locusts,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4854,
      "text": "rushing headlong towards the caller. The disbelievers will say, “This is a hard Day!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4855,
      "text": "The people of Noah rejected [the truth] before them; they rejected Our slave and said, “He is a madman,” and he was intimidated.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4856,
      "text": "So he called upon his Lord, “I am overpowered, so help me!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4857,
      "text": "So We opened the gates of the sky with water pouring down in torrents,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4858,
      "text": "and We caused the earth to burst forth with springs, then the waters met for a preordained purpose.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4859,
      "text": "We carried him on an [Ark made] of planks and nails,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4860,
      "text": "sailing under Our [Watchful] Eyes; as a reward for the one [they] denied.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4861,
      "text": "We have certainly left it[5] as a sign; is there anyone to take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4862,
      "text": "Then how were My punishment and My warnings[6]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4863,
      "text": "We have certainly made the Qur’an easy to understand and remember; is there anyone to take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4864,
      "text": "‘Ād disbelieved. Then how were My punishment and My warnings?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4865,
      "text": "We sent against them a furious wind[7] on a day of continuous misfortune,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4866,
      "text": "sweeping people away[8], as if they were trunks of uprooted palm trees.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4867,
      "text": "Then how were My punishment and My warnings?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
