      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4868,
      "text": "We have certainly made the Qur’an easy to understand and remember; is there anyone to take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4869,
      "text": "Thamūd rejected the warnings,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4870,
      "text": "They said, “Shall we follow a single human being[9] from among us? Then we would surely be in error and insanity!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4871,
      "text": "Has the revelation been sent down upon him out of all of us? Rather, he is an insolent liar.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4872,
      "text": "Tomorrow they will know who the insolent liar is.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4873,
      "text": "We are sending the she-camel as a test for them, so watch them [O Sālih] and be patient,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
